B.aH2=s(["So\u011fan\u0131 zeytinya\u011f\u0131nda kavur, sal\xe7ay\u0131 ekle.","Y\u0131kan\u0131p do\u011franm\u0131\u015f \u0131spanak ve nohudu ekle, kapa\u011f\u0131 kapal\u0131 10 dakika pi\u015fir.","Yo\u011furtla servis et. Gebelikte \u0131spana\u011f\u0131 iyice y\u0131ka, yo\u011furdun past\xf6rize olsun."],t.s)
