B.aBY=s(["Gebelikte kilo verme hedefi konmaz. \xd6nerilen art\u0131\u015f gebelik \xf6ncesi BK\u0130'ye g\xf6re de\u011fi\u015fir (IOM 2009): normal kiloda 11,5\u201316 kg, fazla kiloda 7\u201311,5 kg, obezitede 5\u20139 kg.","Obezitesi olan gebelerde daha az kilo al\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcvenli olabilece\u011fini g\xf6steren yeni \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar var; bu karar mutlaka hekim ve diyetisyen kontrol\xfcnde verilir.","\xc7i\u011f et, \xe7i\u011f yumurta, past\xf6rize edilmemi\u015f s\xfct \xfcr\xfcnleri ve y\xfcksek c\u0131val\u0131 bal\u0131klardan (k\u0131l\u0131\xe7, k\xf6pek bal\u0131\u011f\u0131) ka\xe7\u0131n."],t.s)
B.bjo=new A.mE("Kilo al\u0131m\u0131 hakk\u0131nda",B.aBY,B.aV,null)
B.aBb=s(["Yaln\u0131zca anne s\xfct\xfcyle besleyen annenin enerji ihtiyac\u0131 g\xfcnde yakla\u015f\u0131k 500 kcal artar; s\u0131v\u0131 ihtiyac\u0131 da artar.","Kilo kayb\u0131 yava\u015f olmal\u0131 (ayda en fazla ~2 kg); \xe7ok d\xfc\u015f\xfck enerjili diyetler s\xfct miktar\u0131n\u0131 etkileyebilir.","Bal\u0131k (haftada 2 kez, d\xfc\u015f\xfck c\u0131val\u0131), yumurta, s\xfct \xfcr\xfcnleri ve baklagil \xf6nemli."],t.s)
B.bjp=new A.mE("Emzirme d\xf6neminde",B.aBb,null,null)
